<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    The SRD weapon table. Every weapon in the game lives here rather than in a class of its own -
    the same data-driven approach Data/DnDMonsters.xml uses, for the same reason: these are rows in
    a table, not behaviours.

    category   SimpleMelee | SimpleRanged | MartialMelee | MartialRanged
    damage     dice expression; versatile carries the two-handed die separately
    type       Bludgeoning | Piercing | Slashing
    properties comma-separated WeaponProperty values
    itemID     UO art. Reused from the closest-looking legacy item; several weapons share art
               where UO has no distinct graphic (there is no glaive or pike tile, for instance).
    layer      OneHanded unless the weapon needs both hands
-->
